      <text><![CDATA[<p>Determine if the following integral converges or diverges. If the integral converges determine its value.</p>
<p>Note: \( \infty\) is entered as <b>inf</b> and \( -\infty\) is entered as <b>minf</b>.</p>
<p>\( \displaystyle \int_{@lower_limit@}^{@upper_limit@}{@func@} dz={@ta_1@}\)</p>
</p>
<p>Therefore,the integral \(={@ta_4@}\)</p>]]></text>
